# AMG-WebUI Vision
- AMG-WebUI is a Vue 3 enterprise UI infrastructure, not an Element Plus skin or component-count project.
- Prefer stable shared runtimes and engines over duplicated component logic.
- Keep foundation, business, industry, media, low-code, telemetry and skill capabilities separated.
- Design for API stability, SSR, accessibility, theming, RTL, performance and package consumption.
- Quality is determined by contracts and verified gates, not code size, demo count or heuristic score.
- Do not add low-value components merely to increase inventory.
- Architecture consistency has higher priority than short-term speed.
